---
import BaseHead from '../components/BaseHead.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import { SITE_DESCRIPTION, SITE_TITLE } from '../consts';
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
	<head>
		<BaseHead title={SITE_TITLE} description={SITE_DESCRIPTION} />
	</head>
	<body>
		<Header />
		<main>
			<h1>Hello and welcome!</h1>
			<p>
				So if I had to summarise my aim for this amazing blog it would be that this is a little site for me to
				catalogue all my reviews and current bucket-list for all sorts of albums. This first started all the way
				back in the not-so-distant past of June 2026 when I turned to myself and said "Man I need to listen to
				more music!" and so the saga begun.
			</p>
			<p>
				Within this blog you can find pages for each month since that saga began, and within each pages contains the highlights
				of the albums I listened to that month. On top of that, I also have a page containing my personal bucket-list of albums 
				I plan to listen to at some point in the future.
			</p>
			<p>
				Thank you for stopping by and feel free to suggest any albums you think that I should listen to.
			</p>
		</main>
		<Footer />
	</body>
</html>
